# Normalise commit authors for display.
#
# The initial commits were authored by a generic project identity so that the
# maintainer's local git config was never modified. GitHub attributes commits by
# email; this file maps the generic identity onto the real maintainer so the
# contributor graph and commit links resolve correctly.
#
# Format: Real Name <real@email>  Old Name <old@email>

